[0.0, "o", "This footage captures a family trip to the \u001b[1m2026 Chiang Mai Flower Festival\u001b[39m, from a first-person perspective following a multi-generational group.\r\n\r\nThe material covers:\r\n1.  \u001b[1mFloral Parade:\u001b[39m Ornate Thai floats with intricate flower arrangements, in daylight and illuminated at night.\r\n2.  \u001b[1mNight Market Food:\u001b[39m Street food stalls featuring Luk Chup, Khao Lam, grilled skewers, and Thai drinks.\r\n3.  \u001b[1mFamily Moments:\u001b[39m The boy cooking at a \"Mini Kitchen\" stall and the grandfather learning to say \"Aroy.\"\r\n4.  \u001b[1mFestival Atmosphere:\u001b[39m Crowds, a Megatron cosplayer, and a Tuk-tuk ride past the ancient city walls.\r\n\r\nHow would you like me to edit this? I can focus on family interactions, a foodie angle, or a balanced highlight reel.\r\n"]
